Vendored copy notice (for author-persona-skill):

Package : jieba 0.42.1 (https://github.com/fxsjy/jieba, MIT)
Author  : Sun, Junyi <ccnusjy@gmail.com>

Only the modules required by this skill are bundled, to keep the archive
portable and free of platform-locked binaries:

  jieba/__init__.py, _compat.py, dict.txt
  jieba/finalseg/   (HMM fallback segmentation)
  jieba/posseg/     (part-of-speech tagging: nr/ns/nt/nz, used for named
                     entities and the five worldview vocabulary classes)

Deliberately NOT bundled:
  jieba/analyse/    (TF-IDF / TextRank keyword extraction -- unused here)
  jieba/lac_small/  (optional compiled LAC model)
  posseg/*.p, finalseg/*.p
                    (pickle model files read only on Jython; on CPython the
                     equivalent .py model modules are imported instead)
